{"name":"-44-B3-1-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Hit","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Slam! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A loud noise suddenly comes from Machlian's room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II, who is just about to capture a bug by the windowsill, is startled by the noise and jumps. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The gray-colored bug flaps its wings and takes off."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Dorm","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Inside the room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's face is contorted with rage. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Their tightly-clenched fists slowly loosen from where they have savagely pounded the table, and the edges of their palms are starting to flush red."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Forgive me. I forgot myself."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander shoves away the chair behind them and gets up. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They massage their throbbing temples to ease the aggravating headache."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps you should take a break, Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once again, Dandelion is the first person to break the awkward silence."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...RO, please look after Machlian for me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander scratches their head in frustration before turning to leave. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dandelion looks at RO, and when the latter nods back with understanding, she follows the Commander out of the room."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hope you don't mind. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander is a little on edge today. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This usually doesn't happen."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph, why are you being so nice to her? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":" We should have done this a long time ago."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander got a call last night. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A very important friend of ours is in a very bad state. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's why the Commander was questioning you so early this morning. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Please don't take it personally."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Machlian's closed eyes slowly open."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, I'm fine. I've been treated worse than this. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But...Robin seems like a completely different person today. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That friend must be very important to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What does that have to do with you? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You ask all sorts of questions, but when it comes to how to make that medicine, you won't say a word. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Weren't you going on and on about saving people? Guess it doesn't matter all that much to you after all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Machlian lowers her head in response to ST AR-15's disdain, but otherwise takes no offense."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It wouldn't do any good even if I told you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You don't just need the right method to process my blood, but also specialized equipment. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And that equipment can only be found in that place."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So why don't you take us there? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're just making excuses."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's enough, 15. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's already trying to come up with another solution. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There's no point making a fuss here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm really worried about Kalina... Is she going to be alright?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Miss Kalina will be fine. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You've known her for longer than I have, so you should know better than me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It would take a lot more than ELID to beat her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hope you're right..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Pardon me, but if I may ask, is this Kalina that friend of yours?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's none of your damn business."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I heard you mention her name many times... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She must mean a lot to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So you've found someone new to suck up to? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, we won't fall for it this time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"15, that's enough!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...She's the adjutant at the Griffin base. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's a very dependable and trustworthy person."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Does she have ELID too?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...So that's why Robin's acting so weird today."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I can't say that isn't the case."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then she must be a very important person."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course! Everyone at Griffin is super important!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But if everyone is important, doesn't that mean nobody is?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Huh? Eh? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No, they're all important!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"War is very cruel, especially in this day and age. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, the Commander is not a very mature leader. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There are some things that only an immature leader can say or do."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Machlian","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Machlian","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Machlian gazes at RO and contemplates in silence."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kolibri","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Door_Close","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"background","value":"2021white_GriffinSPAWAR","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":"Kolibri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Should we try to draw her blood? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Earl may be able to analyze it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"VP1915","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Perosa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't underestimate William's research. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even the Earl is impressed by his technical skill. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, the Earl is busy with something crucial and nobody should disturb him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Fedorov","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Fedorov","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then what about sending a sample back to the Commander's base? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't that Miss Persica a researcher on William's level?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Persica specializes in a very different field than William. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, considering his personality, he might have done something weird with Machlian's blood to prevent others from acquiring it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I believe that at the moment, the only way to extract the key elements from Machlian's blood is with William's technology."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...In other words, we need to find the equipment Machlian mentioned?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narra